  "body": "## What's New in v3.10\n\n### UI Overhaul\n- Redesigned Admin Overview with ROG-style animations\n- Updated buttons: Telegram support, removed Docs, fixed GitHub link\n- Renamed section to 'Alxzen Panel Features'\n- Full ServerRow upgrade: scan-line, adaptive progress bars, glow effects\n- Dashboard entrance animations with stagger effect\n- Admin Server List: cascade row animations, blinking status badges\n\n### Security\n- Protect V3: Restrict non-ID-1 admins from server list/delete, user delete, and Nest/Egg/DB modifications"
